Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         fontconfig,
         gettext-base,
         imagemagick,
         yad
Description: preview and install a font file for the current user
 instalador-de-fontes opens a font file (TrueType, OpenType, WOFF or
 WOFF2) in a small window with a sample text rendered in that font and
 its name, style, type, family and foundry. When confirmed, the font is
 copied to ~/.local/share/fonts and the fontconfig cache is refreshed.
 .
 The program, font-installer-gui, is offered by the file manager for
 font files. The interface is translated (gettext) and follows the
 language of the session.
